ub, Schedule Call / View Case Study buttons, hero stats below (230+, text, progress bar, trending badge)\n- Hero right: visual composition with traffic card, projects & avatars card, video poster\n\nThen:\n- Trusted by (logo row)\n- About\n- Case studies  \n- Testimonial\n- FAQ\n- Blog\n- CTA banner\n- Footer\n\nThat covers all must-includes. Let me start by copying the Button + icons into workspace page, and create my components.\n\nStrategy: I'll create a \"MAC · Components\" frame in workspace to hold all local components. Actually for components in Figma, they can live anywhere; better to put them at top of workspace page in a components frame, then the 01_Home frame below.\n\nLet me first copy all needed source components into workspace. I'll use figma.getNodeByIdAsync and .clone() — clone keeps them in same page. I need to move them to workspace page.\n\nApproach: for each source component (2:2..2:17 icons, 2:16 logo, 1:28 button), clone, then appendChild to workspace page.\n\nThen build my local components wrapping instances of these.\n\nLet me write a comprehensive script. Since scripts have 50k char limit, I'll split into multiple calls.\n\nStep 1: Copy all media components + button into workspace page inside a \"· Local Components\" area.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7550319e-df42-470d-836f-618f29282362","uuid":"e58c5be4-bf25-442c-b504-206cc771cd42","timestamp":"2026-11-02T01:56:31.454Z","thinking_duration_ms":19346}
