{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":40835,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"04206ae7ef480a7af83cd1584234a628","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Wait — I put the overlay inside thumb, but thumb uses auto-layout with primaryAxisAlignItems CENTER — appending overlay will mess layout. Better to disable layout on thumb, or position overlay manually. Let me fix: I appended overlay via auto-layout so it would sit next to placeholderMark, not on top. Let me fix by removing that and repositioning.\n\nActually let me check: thumb has layoutMode HORIZONTAL. When I appendChild overlay, the overlay becomes a child participating in layout. To stack, I should set thumb.layoutMode = 'NONE' and position overlay absolutely at 0,0 and center placeholderMark manually.\n\nLet me fix now.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7550319e-df42-470d-836f-618f29282362","uuid":"371f3bd0-98f7-4dd7-b8ff-3cf9105093ad","timestamp":"2026-11-02T02:03:02.527Z","thinking_duration_ms":4302}
